  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 13.48,
      "end": 18.78,
      "text": "Before the avenue wakes, hits silver glass, I wash my hands in a rented room door.",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 19.0,
      "end": 23.54,
      "text": "Subway shakes the cups along the shelf like every cup has somewhere else to rock.",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 23.58,
      "end": 25.8,
      "text": "My mother says, keep mercy in your speech.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 25.94,
      "end": 28.28,
      "text": "My father says, let no fear make you small.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 28.28,
      "end": 31.4,
      "text": "On the elevator sees my beard and groans, I say, easy friend.",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 31.62,
      "end": 33.28,
      "text": "I'm late for work, that's all.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 33.42,
      "end": 35.6,
      "text": "The dream is packed, who's judging who?",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 38.22,
      "end": 40.28,
      "text": "Everybody's late, that much is true.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 43.02,
      "end": 46.2,
      "text": "I carry more than one sky over me.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 48.04,
      "end": 50.82,
      "text": "Neither one asks the other to leave.",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 52.36,
      "end": 55.6,
      "text": "Between prayer and pavement, I make my way.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 56.88,
      "end": 59.56,
      "text": "Through the noise of a city that names me",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 59.56,
      "end": 61.64,
      "text": "Before I can say",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 61.64,
      "end": 65.8,
      "text": "I am not your warning, I am not your war",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 66.62,
      "end": 69.72,
      "text": "I am a neighbor with a key at the door",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 70.96,
      "end": 74.26,
      "text": "Between prayer and pavement, hear me play",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 75.68,
      "end": 80.24,
      "text": "I can hold to my faith without handing you pain",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 80.24,
      "end": 84.88,
      "text": "There is room in this town for the truth I bring",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 84.88,
      "end": 89.82,
      "text": "For a covered head, for a beard, for a human being",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 91.06,
      "end": 94.68,
      "text": "And word below our voices when I pass",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 95.78,
      "end": 99.1,
      "text": "A headline hangs like smoke above the screen",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 100.8,
      "end": 103.96,
      "text": "Someone asked me where I learned to speak",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 103.96,
      "end": 108.94,
      "text": "I say Queens and my auntie's kitchen in between",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 109.76,
      "end": 113.32,
      "text": "My sister walks with fabric at her hair",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 114.62,
      "end": 118.1,
      "text": "And catches every guest before it lands",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 118.1,
      "end": 122.1,
      "text": "She says my scarf is not breaking news",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 122.1,
      "end": 124.12,
      "text": "But thank you for the weather update",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 124.12,
      "end": 126.4,
      "text": "Mary, is that a sermon in the break room?",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 126.66,
      "end": 129.9,
      "text": "I know it's coffee, yours is probably fine",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 129.9,
      "end": 134.52,
      "text": "Some want tradition to become a cage",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 134.52,
      "end": 139.38,
      "text": "Some want freedom with no room for age",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 139.38,
      "end": 142.64,
      "text": "Between prayer and pavement I make my way",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 143.92,
      "end": 148.62,
      "text": "Through the noise of a city that names me before I can say",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 148.62,
      "end": 153.3,
      "text": "I am not your warning, I am not your war",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 153.3,
      "end": 158.12,
      "text": "I am a neighbor with a key at the door",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 158.12,
      "end": 161.38,
      "text": "Between prayer and pavement, hear me claim",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 162.72,
      "end": 167.28,
      "text": "I can hold to my faith without handing you pain",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 167.28,
      "end": 172.06,
      "text": "There is room in this town for the truth I bring",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 172.06,
      "end": 176.74,
      "text": "For a covered head, for a beard, for a human being",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 180.56,
      "end": 184.06,
      "text": "I wrestled with the words I was handed",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 185.14,
      "end": 188.68,
      "text": "And the words the whole block throws back",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 190.04,
      "end": 193.5,
      "text": "Not every old command is a kindness",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 194.46,
      "end": 198.32,
      "text": "If I pause for a prayer beside the deli",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 198.32,
      "end": 202.62,
      "text": "No, the sidewalk will not split in two",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 203.68,
      "end": 207.12,
      "text": "If you ask with care, I'll answer honestly",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 207.12,
      "end": 209.96,
      "text": "If you guess for me, I may tease you",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 209.96,
      "end": 213.24,
      "text": "Can a city hold a complicated soul?",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 213.26,
      "end": 214.7,
      "text": "It holds eight million",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 214.7,
      "end": 216.8,
      "text": "Give it room to grow",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 217.94,
      "end": 222.74,
      "text": "Between prayer and pavement, I choose my name",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 222.74,
      "end": 225.26,
      "text": "Not a symbol for your anger",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 225.26,
      "end": 227.52,
      "text": "Not a mask for your blame",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 227.52,
      "end": 232.26,
      "text": "I will meet your eyes, I will stand at the door",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 232.26,
      "end": 236.92,
      "text": "With the city in my blood and my faith at the core",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 236.92,
      "end": 241.5,
      "text": "Between prayer and pavement, let the morning appear",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 241.5,
      "end": 246.14,
      "text": "Let the room hold questions, let it make room for fear",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 246.14,
      "end": 251.08,
      "text": "Then let mercy be louder than the stories we tell",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 251.08,
      "end": 256.92,
      "text": "I am here, I am whole and I wish you well",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 257.96,
      "end": 262.78,
      "text": "When the last train carries its light through the rain",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 262.78,
      "end": 266.74,
      "text": "I lift my face and breathe my name",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 266.74,
      "end": 270.92,
      "text": "Not a warning, not a war, just me",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 270.92,
      "end": 274.62,
      "text": "Home between prayer and pavement",
      "uncertain": false
    }
